                                        "entry_id": "04230abb-5b34-3637-8bf5-eded306807f1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The presence in the bloodstream of microorganisms or their toxins in a sufficient quantity to cause serious illness; sepsis or septicemia."
                                        ],
